<script setup lang="ts">import {fixed,probability,logValue} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{conflicts:any}>()</script><template><section class="conflict-panel"><p class="eyebrow">CONTRADICTORY EVIDENCE / MINIMAL CONFLICT GROUPS</p><h2>全部最小冲突证据组</h2><p class="method-note">仅以联合logZ=−∞判定严格不可能；有限logZ即使exp下溢仍属正概率联合证据，不进入本表。原证据 {{JSON.stringify(conflicts.original_evidence)}} 与本次失败记录保留，未被改写。</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>组</th><th>观测</th><th>大小</th><th>逐项移除后的logZ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(g,index) in conflicts.minimal_conflict_groups" :key="index"><td>#{{index+1}}</td><td><span v-for="o in g.observations" :key="o.node" class="conflict-observation">{{o.node}}={{o.value}}</span></td><td>{{g.size}}</td><td><span v-for="c in g.proper_subset_checks" :key="c.node" class="conflict-check">撤{{c.node}} → logZ {{logValue(c.remaining_log_evidence)}}（可行）</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="method-note">{{conflicts.method}}。每组均为联合概率严格为0的极小证据子集。</p></section><section class="retraction-panel"><p class="eyebrow">MINIMUM RETRACTION PLANS / RECOMPUTED POSTERIOR + IG</p><h2>恢复可行的全部最少撤回方案</h2><p class="method-note">最少撤回 {{conflicts.minimum_retraction_count}} 项观测；以下 {{conflicts.retraction_plans.length}} 个方案沿用原案例的同一CPT版本与查询目标，只重算后验与候选信息增益。方案仅登记在本次失败底稿，不自动改写原案例、证据或概率版本。</p><article v-for="(plan,index) in conflicts.retraction_plans" :key="index" class="retraction-row"><h3>方案 {{index+1}} · 撤掉 <span v-for="o in plan.retracted_observations" :key="o.node" class="conflict-observation">{{o.node}}={{o.value}}</span></h3><p>剩余证据 {{JSON.stringify(plan.remaining_evidence)}} · logZ {{logValue(plan.log_evidence)}} · Z {{probability(plan.evidence_probability,plan.evidence_probability_underflow)}}</p><p><b>重算 {{plan.target}} 后验</b>：P({{plan.target}}=1 | E′)={{probability(plan.target_posterior[1].probability,plan.target_posterior[1].probability_underflow)}} · H(Q|E′)={{fixed(plan.target_entropy,6)}} bit</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>候选</th><th>P(X|E′)</th><th>H(Q|E′)</th><th>期望熵</th><th>原始IG bit</th><th>展示IG bit</th><th>分支logZ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="c in plan.candidates" :key="c.node_id"><td>{{c.node_id}}<small v-if="c.newly_unobserved">新增</small></td><td><span v-for="b in c.branches" :key="b.state">{{b.state}}:{{probability(b.probability,b.probability_underflow)}}</span></td><td>{{fixed(c.prior_entropy,6)}}</td><td>{{fixed(c.expected_entropy,6)}}</td><td>{{fixed(c.raw_information_gain,8)}}</td><td>{{fixed(c.information_gain,6)}}</td><td><span v-for="b in c.branches" :key="b.state">{{b.state}}:{{logValue(b.log_evidence)}}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="method-note" v-if="!plan.candidates.length">该方案下没有未观测的非目标候选；后验与证据分母仍完整保留。</p><p class="method-note">候选范围＝原案例候选集（{{plan.case_candidates.join('、')||'无'}}）∪撤回后新变为未观测的节点（{{plan.newly_unobserved_candidates.join('、')||'无'}}，仅列于底稿，不回写原案例）。表中“新增”即后者。</p></article></section></template>
